<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Materials -- Gemstone List</h1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>

<pre>

Note:  Gem combos are sometimes unstable -- please let me know if you get 
different alloy results than this list shows.  Probably it's an unstable combo
and should be noted (usually things like ruby/sapphire interchange)... but it
could be an error that needs to be corrected.


<b>List compiled by Dryad.</b>


alexandrite + amethyst = ?
alexandrite + aquamarine = chrysoberyl
alexandrite + bloodstone = ?
alexandrite + carnelian = opal 
alexandrite + chrysoberyl = aquamarine 
alexandrite + diamond = zircon 
alexandrite + emerald = ?
alexandrite + garnet = opal 
alexandrite + jade = emerald
alexandrite + malachite = opal
alexandrite + moss agate = ?
alexandrite + olivine = opal
alexandrite + onyx = olivine
alexandrite + opal = chrysoberyl 
alexandrite + quartz = opal
alexandrite + rhodonite = ?
alexandrite + ruby = opal
alexandrite + sapphire = opal
alexandrite + sunstone = opal 
alexandrite + topaz = opal
alexandrite + turquoise = ?
alexandrite + zircon = aquamarine 


amethyst + aquamarine = sunstone
amethyst + bloodstone = carnelian or moss agate (unstable?)
amethyst + carnelian = moss agate 
amethyst + chrysoberyl = opal 
amethyst + diamond = olivine
amethyst + emerald = sunstone
amethyst + garnet = ?
amethyst + jade = sunstone 
amethyst + malachite = sunstone
amethyst + moss agate = carnelian
amethyst + olivine = carnelian or moss agate (unstable combo)
amethyst + onyx = carnelian
amethyst + opal = sunstone 
amethyst + quartz = carnelian 
amethyst + rhodonite = sunstone
amethyst + ruby = olivine 
amethyst + sapphire = olivine 
amethyst + sunstone = carnelian
amethyst + topaz = sunstone
amethyst + turquoise = carnelian
amethyst + weenite = carnelian
amethyst + zircon = sunstone 


aquamarine + alexandrite = chrysoberyl
aquamarine + amethyst = sunstone
aquamarine + bloodstone = quartz
aquamarine + carnelian = sunstone
aquamarine + chrysoberyl = alexandrite
aquamarine + diamond = zircon
aquamarine + emerald = opal
aquamarine + garnet = ?
aquamarine + jade = opal
aquamarine + malachite = opal
aquamarine + moss agate = ?
aquamarine + olivine = zircon
aquamarine + onyx = olivine
aquamarine + opal = zircon
aquamarine + quartz = rhodonite
aquamarine + rhodonite = zircon
aquamarine + ruby = zircon
aquamarine + sapphire = zircon
aquamarine + sunstone = zircon
aquamarine + topaz = opal
aquamarine + turquoise = opal
aquamarine + zircon = opal


bloodstone + alexandrite = ?
bloodstone + amethyst = carnelian or moss agate (unstable?)
bloodstone + aquamarine = quartz
bloodstone + carnelian = amethyst
bloodstone + chrysoberyl = alexandrite
bloodstone + diamond = olivine
bloodstone + emerald = sunstone
bloodstone + garnet = emerald
bloodstone + jade = quartz
bloodstone + malachite = quartz
bloodstone + moss agate = carnelian
bloodstone + olivine = quartz
bloodstone + onyx = moss agate
bloodstone + opal = quartz
bloodstone + quartz = amethyst
bloodstone + rhodonite = quartz
bloodstone + ruby = sunstone
bloodstone + sapphire = sunstone
bloodstone + sunstone = quartz
bloodstone + topaz = quartz
bloodstone + turquoise = quartz
